---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section section--inverse cta" id="contact" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="container-sm cta__inner" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="cta-title" class="t-display">Interested?<br /><span class="hl">Let’s talk!</span></h2>
    <p>Looking for someone who can help bring clarity to complex ideas and turn strategy into thoughtful creative work? I’d love to hear about your team, your challenges, and what you’re looking to build.</p>
    <a href={site.mailto} class="btn">Let’s Talk</a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .cta { padding-bottom: var(--space-10); }
  .cta__inner { display: grid; justify-items: center; text-align: center; gap: var(--space-6); max-width: 500px; }
  .cta h2 { color: var(--color-white); }
  .cta p { font-size: var(--fs-body-lg); text-align: justify; text-align-last: center; hyphens: auto; }
  .cta .btn { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .cta p { text-align: center; } }
</style>
